{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object visible, approach, take it, check properties and process. Otherwise, scan or move. Go!     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObjectTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRange    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = MoveToRandomLocation    />",
